{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415769","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415769","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041576901:1":{"text":"亲爱的，听说你也是一家餐馆的老板？做的一手好菜？","source_cn":"亲爱的，听说你也是一家餐馆的老板？做的一手好菜？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB321B999291E0F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576902:1":{"text":"我是餐饮品牌的主理人，最近开的一家新店是赛凡纳的丝绒陷阱。","source_cn":"我是餐饮品牌的主理人，最近开的一家新店是赛凡纳的丝绒陷阱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C04029B3D5BE0F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576903:1":{"text":"主理人是什么？最近流行的新说法吗？","source_cn":"主理人是什么？最近流行的新说法吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4517D18EE99F909","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576904:1":{"text":"哈哈，我在雪松镇待久了，想向你打听打听外面的生意好不好做。","source_cn":"哈哈，我在雪松镇待久了，想向你打听打听外面的生意好不好做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92AFC1AEF2D9C6D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576905:1":{"text":"说不定，以后我也能在赛凡纳开家白熊温泉旅店的分店呢！","source_cn":"说不定，以后我也能在赛凡纳开家白熊温泉旅店的分店呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A49ECEAD74A567F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576906:1":{"text":"上城区租金不菲，你的旅店若想选址的话，选下城区更为合适。","source_cn":"上城区租金不菲，你的旅店若想选址的话，选下城区更为合适。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE6C6748A429481A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576907:1":{"text":"现在还没考虑那么多呢！你先跟我说说，赛凡纳最近都流行吃些什么好东西？","source_cn":"现在还没考虑那么多呢！你先跟我说说，赛凡纳最近都流行吃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA5CECB4D92D2072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576908:1":{"text":"松露、鹅肝之类的自不必提，最近贵族们颇爱品味极致纯粹的口感。","source_cn":"松露、鹅肝之类的自不必提，最近贵族们颇爱品味极致纯粹的口感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4C0E4E969A264BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576909:1":{"text":"比如……刚从深海捕捞上来、完全未经任何火焰破坏的冰海银鱼。","source_cn":"比如……刚从深海捕捞上来、完全未经任何火焰破坏的冰海银鱼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03A24631B250D841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576910:1":{"text":"我们会用极细的晶丝将其悬吊，在绝对低温的室内，用银刀片下薄如蝉翼的鱼肉，保留它最原始鲜活的冰冷触感。","source_cn":"我们会用极细的晶丝将其悬吊，在绝对低温的室内，用银刀片...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682FB25E85BE9FB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576911:1":{"text":"什么？吃没有经过烹饪、连调料都不放的生鱼？","source_cn":"什么？吃没有经过烹饪、连调料都不放的生鱼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BF1740B92D81ACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576912:1":{"text":"我的老天爷！你们赛凡纳的贵族是不怕拉肚子吗？","source_cn":"我的老天爷！你们赛凡纳的贵族是不怕拉肚子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43A4DE238BEB0C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576913:1":{"text":"呵……这样才能品味纯粹的鲜美。任何粗暴的高温烹煮，只会让食材脆弱的结构遭到破坏，流失掉最高贵的鲜味。","source_cn":"呵……这样才能品味纯粹的鲜美。任何粗暴的高温烹煮，只会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCDAD56A328B797","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576914:1":{"text":"哎哟喂，要我说，鱼就得在热锅里煎得两面金黄，或者和蘑菇一起炖成浓汤！","source_cn":"哎哟喂，要我说，鱼就得在热锅里煎得两面金黄，或者和蘑菇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A9A5FE3E5DC94B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576915:1":{"text":"那一口热乎汤下肚，整个人都暖和过来了！","source_cn":"那一口热乎汤下肚，整个人都暖和过来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6ADED40D1F25DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576916:1":{"text":"煎得金黄？那种油腻和焦褐感，简直是对食材的亵渎。","source_cn":"煎得金黄？那种油腻和焦褐感，简直是对食材的亵渎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02693F2132F3A8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576917:1":{"text":"客人来我这儿，就是为了吃个痛快、吃个热闹。","source_cn":"客人来我这儿，就是为了吃个痛快、吃个热闹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A981C1FC015A45A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576918:1":{"text":"要是上盘生肉让他们去体会口感，我这旅店怕是要被砸了！","source_cn":"要是上盘生肉让他们去体会口感，我这旅店怕是要被砸了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0B0FBC05DEF287F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576919:1":{"text":"所以说，雪松镇终究只是个乡下地方。我的经验，对你是没用了。","source_cn":"所以说，雪松镇终究只是个乡下地方。我的经验，对你是没用了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0C6320D8E749742","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576920:1":{"text":"让我做那种冷冰冰的东西给客人吃，我才不乐意呢！","source_cn":"让我做那种冷冰冰的东西给客人吃，我才不乐意呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F560DE2FEC1E1E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041576921:1":{"text":"我还是多做几道温泉香鲱，热乎乎地填饱客人的胃吧！","source_cn":"我还是多做几道温泉香鲱，热乎乎地填饱客人的胃吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C060E57E7D12D93","variant_status":"","male":"","fe